'''Cat Gunslinger''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 3.0 Update|Version 3.0]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 7.0 Update|Version 7.0]] greatly increases health, damage, range and slowdown duration. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.1 Update|Version 8.1]].

