==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Cat Gunslinger was a part of two other [[Cat Combo]]s: [[Crackshot (Removed Combo)|Crackshot]] and [[Triggermen (Removed Combo)|Triggermen]].
*Cat Eastwood is an obvious reference to actor [[wikipedia:Clint Eastwood|Clinton "Clint" Eastwood]].
*Cat Gunslinger's and Cat Eastwood's Japanese descriptions have almost the opposite tone, with Gunslinger's about serving justice, and Eastwood's being about self-protection.
*Cat Eastwood's first language being Italian could possibly reference the "[[wikipedia:Spaghetti Western|spaghetti Western]]" movie genre. Additionally, Clint Eastwood acted in one of the most famous spaghetti Western films, ''[[w:A Fistful of Dollars|A Fistful of Dollars]]''.

